{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"A stronger question emerged: VerifyLeader registers every replicated peer, including nonvoters, but calculates its quorum from voters only. I’ll build a real cluster, isolate the old leader with a nonvoter, let the remaining voter majority commit a new value, then observe whether VerifyLeader approves a stale FSM read.\n"}}
